==Battleground==
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Guile (Enemy)|Guile]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[Blanka (Enemy)|Blanka]] spawns.

==Strategy==
[[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]] is a very good cat in this stage due to its high speed and ability to easily kill the Owlbrows and Mooth. Use other hard hitters like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Dancing Flasher Cat]] to kill off Guile and as long as you have the means to kill Blanka, you should win the stage.

